    "description": {
      "value": "The Cube of Nex acts as a Lesser Cube of Nex except it suppresses all magic within 5 feet of it with the effects of a 10th-level antimagic field spell, instead of just one school. However, spells you cast and magic items you wield ignore the antimagic field from the Cube of Nex.\n\nActivate (2 Actions)\nFrequency: once per minute\nA cube of force or Lesser Cube of Nex within 60 feet of you becomes inert. It can't be Activated, any current activation ends, and any constant abilities it has cease to function."
    },
